+# TCRM THRS-style Database Backup
+
+Adds a dedicated database-only backup flow modeled on THRS:
+- full MySQL/MariaDB dump using mysqldump
+- AES-256-GCM encryption before upload
+- dedicated Google Drive OAuth connection
+- daily automatic backup (default 02:00 Africa/Cairo)
+- keeps latest 3 backups
+- manual Backup Now
+- Admin only; Developer denied
+
+Required environment:
+TCRM_DB_BACKUP_ENCRYPTION_KEY=<64 hex chars or base64 for exactly 32 bytes>
+
+Optional:
+TCRM_MYSQLDUMP_BIN=mysqldump
+TCRM_DB_BACKUP_CONFIG_DIR=/var/lib/tcrm/database-backups
+TCRM_DB_BACKUP_TMP_DIR=/var/tmp/tcrm-db-backups
+
+Management page:
+/admin/database-backup
+
+Google OAuth redirect URI:
+https://<TCRM-domain>/admin/database-backup/google-drive/callback
+
+This feature is independent from the broader Backup Center.
